14 Understanding Variable
---------------------------
# 1) WHY VARIABLES
# - Separate static logic from site-specific data
# - Reuse same playbook across environments
# - Avoid hardcoding usernames/passwords/IPs/OS types

# 2) VARIABLE SOURCES (covered)
# - Play variables            -> vars
# - Variables from file       -> vars_files
# - Prompted variables        -> vars_prompt
# - Dynamic variables         -> set_fact
# - CLI variables             -> --extra-vars / -e
# - Inventory variables       -> inventory/group/host
# - host_vars and group_vars
# - include_vars (task-level include)

# 3) BASIC SYNTAX (vars in play)
---
- name: Play name
  hosts: target_group
  gather_facts: false   # optional (default true)
  vars:                 # optional
    key: value
  tasks:
    - name: Task name
      module_name:
        option: value
...

